---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: "#d6eaf8"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Auth as Identity provider
    User->>Browser: Open the sign-in page
    Browser->>+Auth: Request a login form for the configured tenant, with the return address
    create participant Session as Session store
    Auth->>Session: Start a session
    Session-->>Auth: Session id
    Auth-->>-Browser: Redirect with a code
    Note over Browser: wrap:The browser follows the redirect without asking the user anything else
    activate Browser
    activate Browser
    Browser->>Browser: Exchange the code
    deactivate Browser
    Browser-)User: Show the dashboard
    deactivate Browser
    destroy Session
    Browser-xSession: Sign out
    User<<->>Browser: Keep the tab open
